---
layout: layouts/page.njk
basePath: /contact/
title: Contact
heading: Contact the summit team
standfirst: Three email routes, one phone number that also takes WhatsApp, and a form for everything else.
description: Contact the Kenya-China Tea Summit Secretariat by email, phone or WhatsApp. Registration support, sponsorship, exhibiting, media and general enquiries.
hideCta: true
---

<aside class="rail">
  <h2>Summit office</h2>
  <dl class="spec">
    <div class="field">
      <dt class="label">Summit</dt>
      <dd class="value">{{ summit.name }}</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <dt class="label">Organising body</dt>
      <dd class="value">{{ summit.organiser.name }}</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <dt class="label">Organised by</dt>
      <dd class="value">{{ summit.organiser.legalEntity }}</dd>
    </div>
    {% if summit.partners.length %}
    <div class="field">
      <dt class="label">In partnership with</dt>
      <dd class="value">{% for p in summit.partners %}{{ p.name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</dd>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="field">
      <dt class="label">Telephone and WhatsApp</dt>
      <dd class="value"><a href="tel:{{ summit.contact.phone | replace(" ", "") }}">{{ summit.contact.phone }}</a></dd>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <dt class="label">Office</dt>
      <dd class="value">{{ summit.contact.address.line1 }}, {{ summit.contact.address.line2 }}, {{ summit.contact.address.city }}, {{ summit.contact.address.country }}</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <dt class="label">Summit venue</dt>
      <dd class="value">{{ summit.location.venue }}, {{ summit.location.street }}</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
  <div class="note">
    <p class="note__label">Two addresses</p>
    <p>Woodvale Place is the Secretariat office. The summit itself runs at
      <a href="/venue/">KICC</a> on {{ summit.location.street }}.</p>
  </div>
</aside>

<h2>Email</h2>

<dl class="spec">
  <div class="field">
    <dt class="label">General enquiries</dt>
    <dd class="value"><a href="mailto:{{ summit.contact.email }}">{{ summit.contact.email }}</a></dd>
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <dt class="label">Registration, portal and delegate support</dt>
    <dd class="value"><a href="mailto:{{ summit.contact.supportEmail }}">{{ summit.contact.supportEmail }}</a></dd>
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <dt class="label">Sponsorship, exhibiting, media and partnerships</dt>
    <dd class="value"><a href="mailto:{{ summit.contact.marketingEmail }}">{{ summit.contact.marketingEmail }}</a></dd>
  </div>
</dl>

<h2>Phone and WhatsApp</h2>

<p>The same number takes calls and WhatsApp messages:
<a href="tel:{{ summit.contact.phone | replace(" ", "") }}">{{ summit.contact.phone }}</a>.</p>

<p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="https://wa.me/{{ summit.contact.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp</a></p>

<h2>Office</h2>

<p>{{ summit.organiser.name }}<br>
{{ summit.organiser.legalEntity }}<br>
{{ summit.contact.address.line1 }}<br>
{{ summit.contact.address.line2 }}, {{ summit.contact.address.city }}<br>
{{ summit.contact.address.country }}</p>

<p>This is the Secretariat office. The summit runs at
<a href="/venue/">{{ summit.location.venue }}</a>.</p>

{% set locatorNote = "The summit venue, KICC. Opens Google Maps directions in a new tab." %}
{% include "components/locator.njk" %}

<h2>Send a message</h2>

{% include "components/form-contact.njk" %}
